{title: Waqt Ne Kiya}
{artist: Guru Dutt S D Burman Geeta Dutt}
{key: F#}

{c: Verse 1}
[F#m][E]Waqt Ne Kiya Kya Haseen Sitam        [E][F#][F#m]Tum Rahe Na Tum, Hum Rahe Na Hum

[F#][E]Beqaraar Dil Iss Tarah Mile        [F#]Jis Tarah Kabhi, Hum Juda Na The
[E]Tum Bhi Kho Gaye,        [D]Hum Bhi Kho Gaye
[E]Ek Raah Par        [F#][F#m]Chal Ke Do Qadam

[F#][E]Jaayenge Kahan, Soojhta Nahin        [F#]Chal Pade Magar Raasta Nahin
[E]Kya Talaash Hai,        [D]Kuchh Pata Nahin
[E]Bun Rahe Hain Din,        [F#][F#m]Khwaab Dum-B-Dum

